&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks partners with clients to build impactful digital products which deliver extraordinary customer experiences. We do this by integrating design, strategy and technology. We’re looking for a seasoned product leader, with experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;identifying, launching and scaling&lt;/strong&gt; new products and product portfolio and with a background in &lt;strong&gt;Consultancy and Banking/Fintech&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Customer Experience, Product and Design (CXPD) service line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a trusted advisor to our client’s leadership, you will partner with them to understand their context and needs, make recommendations, and provide advice and hands-on expertise in building new products or reimagining existing products end to end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the innovation mindset across the overall product development lifecycle, utilising lean and hypothesis driven approaches and provide leadership on establishing an effective product operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the market &amp;amp; competitive landscape, go to market strategy and business case or economic model for the opportunity with our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the stakeholders to think about customer’s problems, business outcomes and take them on the change journey of moving to empowered product teams that create strategic growth for the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead large, complex programmes across multiple workstreams and stakeholder groups, owning strategy, roadmap, scope and outcomes end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a consultative selling approach in pre-sales, creating proposals and pitches, shaping engagements for clients and helping to educate both clients and colleagues about the value of our services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape CXPD service line value propositions, creating case studies, points of view and other content through insights on client needs and solutions, and also through defining repeatable practices which will help us to scale our efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the future of product development, with lean squads, fast paced iterations and actively building the next generation ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on where and how AI can meaningfully accelerate or enhance the product development lifecycle; from research and discovery through to delivery and measurement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own or contribute to account growth targets, identifying opportunities to expand existing client relationships into new engagements and revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product leadership experience in building and launching products and establishing high performing product organisations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record leading large-scale, complex programmes and senior stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in commercial and economic modelling, including monetisation strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in bringing an innovation mindset into an organisation at scale and creating sustained innovation investment across strategic horizons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in conducting research and bringing market trends, customer and competitive insights to facilitate strategic ideation to identify opportunities for strategic growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth and expertise in developing value proposition, using lean approaches to test viability, feasibility and desirable to achieve problem-solution and product-market fit before scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate at company, portfolio and product level - defining and executing a strategy, shaping a vision and translating it into a roadmap with clear business and customer value-based measures of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on becoming a value-driven, customer-centric product organisation and drive the change by introducing best practices in product management, value delivery and measurement and making innovation mainstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in AI and its practical application across the product development lifecycle - comfortable evaluating, piloting and advising on AI-enabled tools and approaches for research, discovery, delivery and measurement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at operating and building relationships with C-suite executives and confident in driving conversations at the intersection of technology and business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with consultative selling - diagnosing client needs, co-creating solutions, and building trusted-advisor relationships that convert into engagements, rather than a transactional sales approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to formulate and deliver insights around complex business problems in a thoughtful and persuasive manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills - active listening, persuading and empathising with others and excellent written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about being a visible external voice for the practice - speaking at conferences, contributing to industry panels or publications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product builder and advisor mindset, with strong lean to work with multidisciplinary teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brings a curious, open mindset to challenging established ways of working, and is energised by reimagining the product development lifecycle for a faster-paced, AI-enabled era - treating new tools and methods as opportunities to experiment rather than risks to manage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer amazing benefits from the day you start including private medical insurance, travel insurance, income protection, critical illness, life assurance, pension scheme, personal development budget, 25 days holiday and a ride2work scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;DE&amp;amp;I&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly, passionately and actively strive to make both Thoughtworks and our industry more representative of the communities we serve. We promote diversity in all its forms and reject discrimination and inequality. Our diversity and award winning culture inspires our thought leaders and serves to nurture and develop amazing ideas. We believe this makes us a world leading destination of choice for all technologists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
